@@ -11,6 +11,18 @@ past roughly 500 lines, move the oldest branch groups there.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### feat/player-episode-selection — 2026-11-14 (select an episode from the player panel)
+
+#### Changed
+
+- The series player now passes the current season and episode numbers plus `onEpisodeSelect` to `@white-label/player-web`. Selecting any different episode in the Episodes panel reuses the existing in-player switch flow, fetches that episode's stream and resumes its saved bookmark. Current and invalid selections are ignored.
+- The episode panel's `Episode` type now comes through the app's player bridge from `@white-label/player-web`; this feature no longer imports that type directly from `@white-label/ui-react`. The app's other UI-library usage is unchanged.
+
+#### Notes
+
+- Requires a player package build that exposes episode selection; update it separately with `npm run player:sync`. The player package, lockfile, vendored archive and sync script are deliberately outside this change.
+- Checked with `npm run typecheck` and the 42 focused `SeriesPlayback` / `VideoPlayerOverlay` tests.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 Updated scripts/sync-white-label-player.js to check for pack-web.js instead of pack-web.sh
